A recent landmark publication has observed that stomach (gastric) cancer ranks amongst the top 10 cancers in India.
According to the available data through our comprehensive nationwide registries on cancer incidence, prevalence and mortality in India among males; cancers of lung, mouth, oesophagus and stomach are leading sites of cancer and among females cancer of breast, cervix are leading sites.
Hence, the need to develop a nationwide consensus for clinical management and treatment for various cancers was felt.
